{"about":["'99Vidas' is a brawler set in a contemporary world, but that pays tribute to both the classic and the new in the gaming industry. Brought to you in 16-bit pixelated glory, chock-full of references to not only gaming but also 80's and 90's pop culture. '99Vidas' takes full advantage modern era gameplay mechanics, making it the best of both worlds.","Key Features","• 11 Playable characters","• Up to 4 player co-op across the PS4™ & PS3™ systems","• Story Mode with 6 levels","• Versus Mode","• Survival Mode","• 2 Bonus Levels","• 6 Challenging Boss Fights","• Multiple Upgradable skills","• Multiple Weapons and Special Attacks","• Cross-Play across the PS4™ and PS3™ systems"],"shots":[{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ab4hcxlso2pig3rnmnq3.jpg","thumb":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_screenshot_med/ab4hcxlso2pig3rnmnq3.jpg"},{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/siyn5ntb0vncs6yzdpzh.jpg","thumb":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_screenshot_med/siyn5ntb0vncs6yzdpzh.jpg"},{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/r2aycmkqu13megdk7kav.jpg","thumb":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_screenshot_med/r2aycmkqu13megdk7kav.jpg"},{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/zyeipwajdtmbri549wlh.jpg","thumb":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_screenshot_med/zyeipwajdtmbri549wlh.jpg"},{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/sth1quqhhijr7x0g4qky.jpg","thumb":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_screenshot_med/sth1quqhhijr7x0g4qky.jpg"},{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/pe1dw5mapno0xuezvukg.jpg","thumb":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_screenshot_med/pe1dw5mapno0xuezvukg.jpg"},{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/q5nzue0jj5sfkpfujyle.jpg","thumb":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_screenshot_med/q5nzue0jj5sfkpfujyle.jpg"},{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upl